From 448fa41aeb0d8d2eaa2ccfbc1e5abdd898925d98 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 12:03:40 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] analytics: standalone health-probe toggle (independent of
 export) + preview empty-state

Adds a master "Health probe" switch on Reaper_Analytics.asp that drives
rtraf_hprobe directly, decoupled from export. The per-device collection
already exists in rtrafd; this exposes an on/off control so the probe can
run for the live view + payload preview WITHOUT arming any export mode
(previously the probe only came on as a side effect of enabling export, so
turning export off left nothing to preview - the source of the bare "{}").

  - web.c do_reaper_export_cgi: new action=probe&on=0|1 (CSRF-guarded; sets
    rtraf_hprobe, notify_rc restart_rtraf); status now returns "hprobe".
  - Reaper_Analytics.asp: live Health-probe toggle row; Preview now shows a
    helpful empty-state ("enable the probe" / "on, no samples yet") instead
    of a bare {} when there is nothing to show.
  - www/*.dict (25, lockstep): RANL_46..49.

Rolled in at v2.3.0 with the header fix (owner: do not burn versions).
